473392025_570326435364252_1671269543686935979_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QEh_fiNNeNUQ7kNvwHcM4RT&_nc_oc=AdoQ_UYNY8HpOQ1IYUhFXjuouylWYr6fDyZIgc-R_at9XBFgJDR0CEKNsyDX0hd01B4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPevBXwMIvhcDqtqEJLRys3EgZHbjNTwm_bTsZK_A7plw&oe=6AE0A497"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "646026574804312", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392010_646026578137645_9023846448384584760_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RVLBiT-qKF8Q7kNvwF7tApY&_nc_oc=Adq7NtNiyDBK_epAWXGTn4H7Ly1bE4vBIruyeHwJ3KNOS9E6V1psN8ru8qjLKGKeTpY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPMkbyNJ-HPEbO2x9gf8CrCSSmJ9tSFgG1NKFiQbPD3lw&oe=6AE0B1AA"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1400275601117059", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391924_1400275604450392_6111570253860139230_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eQqP8tDxYoMQ7kNvwF4lGTa&_nc_oc=AdpbIkIYYrNzAxHRajXIh7qzune1I25ulL2emGIVHt3A7Bn8rwMvPDHe_V-rWTpDtuU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPTmsujQ7K49szDzrcqQB5svNyMrsoXvNqeOQdlCnmpHA&oe=6AE0948D"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "2455081078173099", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391888_2455081081506432_2090184349680392773_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v8mXk7KyydkQ7kNvwHks-Vo&_nc_oc=AdobHgwmDlQTgp-XYWEyi8uBkGgfXEmLEu-Kd-m1hNwrJOsC8pP6ua4XS9YmLyHoUZ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNxWaDpMYgHJQsylfYF0Qig8zQetUivpDMAQ2YVyywMbw&oe=6AE0A04D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440.png", "id": "528339819997704", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392309_528339823331037_367341527598948289_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sRJelVFeBdwQ7kNvwHCGrdW&_nc_oc=AdqsM1HrYLPrurR486-4BRqN7vKi8upgy80JMT-In0y_n-S-sUgH0qULZYAojQl_cPE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMBrwGZC6X9ZeExum4wSYvhcCGvpxuKdRRI7cSqXbjE6A&oe=6AE0BE52"}, "display_name": "Punch Beat Arena", "keywords": ["Game", "Rhythm", "Music", "Fitness", "Boxing"], "long_description": "# **\ud83e\udd4a Punch Beat Arena \ud83c\udfb6**\n\nStep into Punch Beat Arena, a high-energy VR boxing game that blends rhythm-based gameplay with fierce action. Get ready to fight to the beat as you throw punches, dodge, and weave to the music in a world where your reflexes and rhythm define your success.\n\n{1070244414940312}\n\n# **Key Features:**\n\n- Rhythm-Driven Boxing: Strike, block, and move in sync with the music. Every action you take is influenced by the beat, offering an exhilarating challenge that combines skill and timing.\n\n- Wide Selection of Tracks & Arenas: Pick from a diverse array of tracks across various genres. Each song brings its own set of challenges and arenas, tailored for both beginners and advanced players.\n\n- Fitness Meets Fun: Punching to the beat isn't just about fun\u2014it's a full-body workout! Sharpen your reflexes and burn calories while enjoying the excitement of the game.\n\n- Immersive Experience: With stunning visuals and high-quality sound design, every round feels like you're truly in the ring, feeling the music pump you up as you fight.\n\n{1030845768901015}\n\nGear up, find your rhythm, and punch your way to victory in Punch Beat Arena, where every beat is a new challenge to conquer!", "short_description": "\ud83e\udd4a Punch Beat Arena \ud83c\udfb6\n\nExperience the ultimate VR rhythm boxing game where every punch and move is synced to the beat. Fight, dodge, and punch to a variety of tracks in immersive arenas. A fun, full-body workout that combines music, action, and fitness in one exciting experience!\nLet's Play !!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tolgakalaycioglu.com/totosgame/PrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Totos